# Everything Apple, and the second web build a release makes for it. `vercel build` walks the
# project before it builds, and a release runs the iOS build at the same time — it would be
# stat-ing files the other half is rewriting, which fails the build for no reason at all.
apps/frontend/ios
apps/frontend/build-ios
apps/frontend/.svelte-kit-ios
